    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "Mathematics feels like a natural bridge between logic and creativity—something both precise yet open to exploration. As someone who enjoys abstract reasoning (like philosophy) but values structured problem-solving, I find it rewarding when broken down into puzzles. My parents’ differing educational backgrounds shaped my perspective: while they saw math as practical or intimidating, I see it as a tool for understanding patterns in the world.",
